{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how an unvoluntary part-time detective assistant of unknown origin modifies minds on a daily basis, humors his boss, keeps his roommate like a cat and hunts down his official love interest half-heartedly in this BL visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/0fe7812e10bce84f3a3f2a4e3c3758e1.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/0fe7812e10bce84f3a3f2a4e3c3758e1.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2079. More than two decades have passed since the AI bubble burst, leaving behind a world where strong AI research is strictly outlawed. But during a live reality show, A bold claim is made\u2014someone among them isn't human, but AI! Some scoff, some seize the moment for attention, and Lucas, a part-time delivery worker, is just an unlucky bystander caught in the chaos\u2014or is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secretly possessing a mind-altering ability hasn\u2019t made Lucas\u2019s life any easier. Two years into adulthood, he remains trapped in the same struggle: jumping between jobs, barely making ends meet, and unable to to move on from the ghosts of his past. Worse still, he may have just landed himself in serious trouble. Maybe it\u2019s time to start pruning his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/4d2b6a3bfb787687a27fe7b264f4db99.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/4d2b6a3bfb787687a27fe7b264f4db99.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=53 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/bcfe3b5eb850191d472e7e867e6b42e1.avif?t=1768296708\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character. A smooth liar, a mind reader, and a psychic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/1f930883b4db4adbd9728a3ab6a1781e.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/1f930883b4db4adbd9728a3ab6a1781e.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roommate and childhood friend, being a dropout but dreaming to design the first AGI in the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/b6782fa42b4f153b53d4516d0ff2bbb9.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/b6782fa42b4f153b53d4516d0ff2bbb9.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nosy detective from an AI regulatory authority who knows a little too much.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/b8fb5aeaa42609da19541c00f3d7b59a.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/b8fb5aeaa42609da19541c00f3d7b59a.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A famous tech upstart, founder of a robotics company.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/031050f908ed4ac9ffab13250a13a028.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/031050f908ed4ac9ffab13250a13a028.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 romanceable characters, 3 branching storylines, leading to 13 impossible endings with 3 happy endings and 1 true ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not entering a route, but exiting one. You must help the protagonist let go of unnecessary characters to step into a personal route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Around 12 hours of gameplay to full achievement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Much drama, little romance. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Toggleable built-in guides and story flowchart</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras/c63ad95a748f7ed916265bb6c580cdda.avif?t=1768296708\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515560/extras_big/c63ad95a748f7ed916265bb6c580cdda.avif?t=1768296708 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Mind Deceivers&quot; Trilogy is a series of psychology science fantasy BL cinematic novels. Titles in this trilogy shares the same world view but can be played independently. Each title has its own characters and story, with only 1-2 recurring characters as cameos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the grand finale of &quot;The Mind Deceivers&quot; Trilogy.</p>","ba